From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josip Seketa <josip.seketa@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:38:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/76] gdb/remote: defer unpushing the target when the
 connection fails

A lost connection unpushed the target inside the I/O functions while callers held its threads; it is now marked lost and unpushed at safe points.

