 {
+  /* If TARGET's connection is lost, TARGET no longer waits to be
+     unpushed at a safe point, however it gets unpushed here (kill,
+     detach, disconnect, ...).  The list's reference may be the last
+     one; keep TARGET alive until the end.  */
